#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:3
#: 2e035971d8224109963bf00ab33fcfa7
msgid "折返螺旋（Folded Helix）"
msgstr "Folded Helix"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:5
#: f87121f702f4426ea0d237061cbc3634
msgid "`Group`: `Magnetism` | `Class`: `FoldedHelixCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:7
#: 8868239b6a974097881addf549027921
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:9
#: e8fa9b0936934365b66179deef9706e2
msgid ""
"按层离散定义对称折返螺旋磁矩纹理。磁矩被限制在垂直于 `plane_normal` 的平面内，沿 `layer_axis` "
"方向在前半周期逐层按固定角度旋转、到转折层后按相同步长反向旋转，形成一个\"先顺时针、到中间再逆时针\"的三角相位轮廓。"
msgstr ""
"Construct a symmetric folded-helix magnetic-moment texture on discrete "
"atomic layers. Moments are confined to the plane normal to "
"`plane_normal`. Along `layer_axis`, they rotate by a fixed angle from one"
" layer to the next during the first half-period, then reverse by the same"
" increment after the turning layer. The result is a triangular phase "
"profile that rotates in one direction and folds back at the midpoint."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:11
#: d07a2021100d4e0399a220de4ae494a9
#, python-brace-format
msgid "s(k)=\\begin{cases}k,&0\\le k\\le h\\\\2h-k,&h\\lt k\\lt2h\\end{cases}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:13
#: e77e8aa450a74f1798ce303c7884dc19
msgid "\\phi(k)=\\phi_0+\\sigma\\cdot s(k)\\cdot\\Delta\\phi"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:15
#: 0d384bd491544543ad10bff2e06a54ad
msgid "默认 `half_period_mode = Auto from layer count`，会在当前层范围上自动构造首尾闭合的折返周期。"
msgstr ""
"With the default `half_period_mode = Auto from layer count`, the card "
"derives a folded period from the detected layers so that the phase closes"
" from the first layer to the last."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:17
#: fc184578dc5f456897635974571d46fd
msgid ""
"**和 `Spin Spiral` 的区别：** `Spin Spiral` "
"沿传播轴连续旋转（单向、不折返）。本卡生成的是\"走一段、折回来\"的分层离散纹理，更适合二维磁体、异质结界面或需要镜像对称磁矩分布的场景。"
msgstr ""
"**How this differs from `Spin Spiral`:** `Spin Spiral` rotates "
"continuously and in one direction along its propagation axis. This card "
"creates a layer-discrete texture that advances and then folds back, "
"making it better suited to two-dimensional magnets, heterostructure "
"interfaces, and mirror-symmetric moment distributions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:19
#: 9bfd5812b21f4fcd8b79bc6e9dcc79b5
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:21
#: af42d14d88fc4b36ba3134e518ab875b
msgid "场景：层状反铁磁模型在非均匀自旋纹理上预测崩塌"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: a layered antiferromagnetic model fails on nonuniform spin "
"textures"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:23
#: 49e767a1e05b4d4490d32368d1e2e790
msgid ""
"你训练了一个层状磁性模型（如 CrI3 双层），训练数据里层内是 FM、层间是 AFM——这是完美均匀的磁序。但实验发现施加电场后，顶层磁矩偏了 "
"15 度而底层偏了 -15 度——这是一个非单调的、分层的自旋纹理。模型对此完全无法预测。"
msgstr ""
"Suppose you trained a model for a layered magnet such as bilayer CrI3. "
"Its training data are ferromagnetic within each layer and "
"antiferromagnetic between layers: perfectly uniform magnetic order. Under"
" an applied electric field, however, the top-layer moments may tilt by "
"15° while the bottom-layer moments tilt by −15°. This is a nonmonotonic, "
"layer-dependent spin texture that the model has never learned."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:25
#: 9f40b0e6a03c449280b79795c56b0d64
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** "
"训练集里的自旋变化是单调的（要么全同向、要么交替翻转）。模型从未见过磁矩方向在空间中\"先转过去、再转回来\"的纹理。需要生成按层离散的折返螺旋构型，让模型学习分层磁矩分布的能量面。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** Spin variation in the training set is monotonic: moments "
"are either aligned or alternate between opposite directions. The model "
"has never seen a texture whose direction rotates away and then returns. "
"Generate layer-discrete folded helices so the model can learn the energy "
"surface associated with nonuniform moment distributions across layers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:27
#: 56a46a580a7a4762a229b9273e91851a
msgid ""
"**输入：** 一个已有 `initial_magmoms` 的层状磁性结构（或通过 `magnitude_source = "
"Map/default magnitude` 指定磁矩模长）"
msgstr ""
"**Input:** A layered magnetic structure with `initial_magmoms`, or a "
"structure for which moment magnitudes can be supplied with "
"`magnitude_source = Map/default magnitude`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:29
#: 0fb307eefc384c66bad282fe8b06d971
msgid ""
"**目标：** 用 auto 模式自动适配当前层数，生成 3 个层间转角（15/30/45 度）、4 个全局相位（0/30/60/90 度）、2 "
"种手性顺序，共 3x4x2 = 24 个折返螺旋构型"
msgstr ""
"**Goal:** Let automatic mode adapt to the detected layer count and "
"generate three interlayer rotation angles (15°, 30°, and 45°), four "
"global phases (0°, 30°, 60°, and 90°), and two chirality sequences, for a"
" total of 3 × 4 × 2 = 24 folded-helix configurations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:31
#: 6f5c878c175448dda0ef8784416147fa
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:32
#: 4ac57b2055da4eb990402848412d48d5
msgid "`Layer Axis` = `[0, 0, 1]`（沿 z 轴分层）"
msgstr "`Layer Axis` = `[0, 0, 1]` (identify layers along *z*)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:33
#: 016cbb7e6d3c4b02b2f96d57a6b2c435
msgid "`Plane Normal` = `[0, 0, 1]`（磁矩在 xy 面内旋转）"
msgstr "`Plane Normal` = `[0, 0, 1]` (rotate moments in the *xy* plane)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:34
#: e7bbd349dc814107a3b488da0a24cbbe
msgid "`Half-Period Mode` = `Auto from layer count`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:35
#: 55d30794244e46129347f72d2eec3969
msgid "`Angle Step Range` = `[15, 45, 15]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:36
#: 632ee5e841ec4e22a105c79d1fffbaf3
msgid "`Phase Range` = `[0, 90, 30]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:37
#: 5649fa92c4f8490aa494a7777cf8e74a
msgid "`Sequence` = `Both`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:39
#: c6a2595836af443e93b247464dc67885
msgid ""
"**输出：** 24 个结构，磁矩在 xy 面内按层折返旋转，带 "
"`FoldedHelix(h=...,da=...,ph=...,seq=...,ax=...,pn=...)` 标签。"
msgstr ""
"**Output:** 24 structures whose moments fold back layer by layer in the "
"*xy* plane, labeled "
"`FoldedHelix(h=...,da=...,ph=...,seq=...,ax=...,pn=...)`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:41
#: e18f307fcdb24d0485e6c5c65e0ccfb0
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:42
#: d3edb5f0e7174198909c6abd3bb441c4
msgid "重训后跑几组不同层间转角的测试构型，能量排序应合理（近 FM 的转角能量低，近 180 度的高）"
msgstr ""
"After retraining, evaluate several test configurations with different "
"interlayer angles. Their energy ordering should be physically reasonable "
"for the target system—for example, angles near its preferred FM alignment"
" should be lower than strongly misaligned states."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:43
#: 9aa6885ac149493ca7d38062c3df0962
msgid "抽查输出：层 0 磁矩方向 = 全局相位，中间层达到最大转角，顶层回到接近全局相位"
msgstr ""
"Inspect several outputs: layer 0 should start at the global phase, the "
"middle layer should reach the largest rotation, and the top layer should "
"return close to the global phase."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:44
#: 04e99a6957de45b2ba265ee77a87636c
msgid ""
"如果 auto 模式给出的半周期不合适——比如你的结构有 10 层但 auto 给了 h=4——切到 manual 模式手动指定 "
"`half_period_layers`"
msgstr ""
"If automatic mode chooses an unsuitable half-period—for example, `h=4` "
"for a ten-layer structure—switch to manual mode and set "
"`half_period_layers` explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:46
#: d7d5a8b4cea8450ea73d8b670b7a1857
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:48
#: 741577e6ac0f41bc9a9f7d52776e3671
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:49
#: 96cbfaa2c5aa4453860c78ada1232f0f
msgid "层状磁体（vdW 磁体、异质结、超晶格）需要非单调的分层磁矩纹理"
msgstr ""
"A layered magnet, such as a van der Waals magnet, heterostructure, or "
"superlattice, needs a nonmonotonic layer-dependent moment texture."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:50
#: ef4a5d0664f54f49a9536909a2cf044f
msgid "想构造镜像对称的自旋分布（两半周期互为镜像）"
msgstr ""
"You want a mirror-symmetric spin distribution whose two half-periods "
"reflect one another."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:51
#: 81b31223af2a493da38942322f7e3c9c
msgid "需要同层原子共享磁矩方向（layer-locked 行为是内置的）"
msgstr ""
"Atoms in the same layer should share one moment direction; layer locking "
"is built in."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:53
#: 0e22c8f1927b4b779d2b6ee204c3bf31
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:54
#: 88d0438dd09149ae92f48e3bd4b93ec5
msgid "需要标准单向传播的螺旋 → 用 `Spin Spiral`"
msgstr "You need a conventional one-way propagating spiral → use `Spin Spiral`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:55
#: ce92fa1c03474f31a12e1a259327362c
msgid "需要连续坐标依赖的相位（非分层）→ 用 `Spin Spiral` 的 continuous 模式"
msgstr ""
"You need a phase that varies continuously with position rather than by "
"layer → use the continuous mode of `Spin Spiral`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:56
#: 84724e627c2247efb162ad4d2b41cfcb
msgid "体系没有层状结构 → 分层无意义"
msgstr ""
"The structure is not layered, so a layer-based texture has no physical "
"meaning."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:58
#: 140748b6506a401d84ecfc14ce1b864a
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:60
#: 6ee9a053aff240caacbb5c2ceeb04933
msgid "分层定义"
msgstr "Layer definition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:62
#: f61f1d9654e445ea978e7291f79e2bf1
msgid "Layer Axis（layer_axis）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:64
#: 8549deab4b694be581722cd8a72cf41b
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, "
"1.0)`。原子坐标沿此方向投影后用于分层，格式 `[x, y, z]`。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. "
"Direction onto which atomic positions are projected to identify layers, "
"expressed as `[x, y, z]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:66
#: 92ffdeddeb13416e8a31aa671a0f1454
msgid "Plane Normal（plane_normal）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:68
#: 1d1cf0244b6a4048a691cddcc39ad314
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, "
"1.0)`。磁矩旋转平面的法向。例如 `[0, 0, 1]` 表示磁矩在 xy 面内旋转。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. "
"Normal vector of the plane in which moments rotate. For example, `[0, 0, "
"1]` constrains them to the *xy* plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:70
#: 5356c233ac064a1d9c373e876a813648
msgid "Layer Tolerance（layer_tolerance）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:72
#: 2d88f2d9fd38480ba8c860beba0d7a38
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.05`。投影坐标差不超过此阈值的原子归为同一层，单位 Å。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.05`. Atoms whose projected coordinates differ by no "
"more than this tolerance are assigned to the same layer. Unit: Å."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:73
#: 13212db5121342a69a1ca8d5b1dd01f8
msgid "保守：`0.01`（严格分层）"
msgstr "Conservative: `0.01` (strict layer separation)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:74
#: 7ad73943217340c6b44ceebf1fcd281d
msgid "平衡：`0.03~0.10`（容忍小幅层内起伏）"
msgstr "Balanced: `0.03–0.10` (allows modest intralayer rumpling)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:75
#: 2f6acd2fa6e9443590a350a69aff1142
msgid "如果层内有明显 rumpling，适当放宽"
msgstr "Increase the tolerance if atoms within a layer show appreciable rumpling."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:77
#: d8a13d0ca9ac47808beaab5d3c19b278
msgid "半周期控制"
msgstr "Half-period control"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:79
#: 69f25f5452d24a48b0f25e69cb670ab6
msgid "Half Period Mode（half_period_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:81
#: b63da35118614fde80eca44b3cb42547
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Auto from layer count'`。`Auto from layer count` "
"由当前层数自动推导半周期，保证首尾闭合（大多数情况推荐这个）。`Manual` 手动指定 `half_period_layers` "
"扫描范围，适合比较不同折返周期。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Auto from layer count'`. `Auto from layer count` "
"derives a half-period from the detected layers and closes the phase "
"between the first and last layers; this is recommended in most cases. "
"`Manual` scans the range set by `half_period_layers` and is useful for "
"comparing different folded periods."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:83
#: 5f384870f1b545c0b3651462d632f697
msgid "Half Period Layers（half_period_layers）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:85
#: 302c4086bf954d80b1edc36e2a834e86
msgid ""
"`list[int] | tuple[int, int, int]`，默认 `(2, 4, 1)`。仅在 manual 模式下生效。`[min, "
"max, step]` 格式，半周期的层步进数。"
msgstr ""
"`list[int] | tuple[int, int, int]`, default: `(2, 4, 1)`. Used only in "
"manual mode. Expressed as `[minimum, maximum, step]`, it scans the number"
" of layer intervals in one half-period."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:86
#: 3cf849bf9be14fc4bc0f0bf9de8c7dab
msgid "保守：`[2, 2, 1]`（最短折返）"
msgstr "Conservative: `[2, 2, 1]` (shortest fold)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:87
#: 2ef84be948b14ee186b76da4db45620d
msgid "平衡：`[2, 6, 1]`"
msgstr "Balanced: `[2, 6, 1]`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:88
#: c11b8999b4124c4b87453cf074b91173
msgid "探索：`[4, 12, 2]`"
msgstr "Exploratory: `[4, 12, 2]`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:90
#: ec446676f475430a8bea76116cffea72
msgid "旋转参数"
msgstr "Rotation parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:92
#: 8e168ad1af674d46a628d448cd584bf9
msgid "Angle Step Range（angle_step_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:94
#: fb18c4f75c424156b6e91e98c01f02d3
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(15.0, 45.0, 15.0)`。`[min,"
" max, step]`，相邻层之间的面内转角，单位度。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(15.0, 45.0, "
"15.0)`. In-plane rotation between adjacent layers, in degrees, expressed "
"as `[minimum, maximum, step]`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:95
#: c6ec7e1596b042c9991ced199a9ce2f8
msgid "保守：`[5, 15, 5]`（小转角）"
msgstr "Conservative: `[5, 15, 5]` (small rotations)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:96
#: 3a19a8a5c1b648de9b1e65ffd587a34c
msgid "平衡：`[15, 45, 15]`（中转角）"
msgstr "Balanced: `[15, 45, 15]` (moderate rotations)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:97
#: 44a829b73ee541af9b623b361f419d45
msgid "探索：`[30, 90, 15]`（大转角）"
msgstr "Exploratory: `[30, 90, 15]` (large rotations)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:99
#: 1d49bf3f55724b43a58101c71ccdc640
msgid "Phase Range（phase_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:101
#: 46c0a1430db647eb9ffedb95c0eea96a
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 15.0)`。`[min, "
"max, step]`，全局相位偏移，单位度。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(0.0, 0.0, 15.0)`. "
"Global phase offsets as `[min, max, step]` in degrees."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:102
#: 9db9e865f8c5468c9711f5a6f9e35ab8
msgid "保守：`[0, 0, 15]`"
msgstr "Conservative: `[0, 0, 15]`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:103
#: a4eadf261de5441c90b4454ecd342987
msgid "平衡：`[0, 90, 30]`"
msgstr "Balanced: `[0, 90, 30]`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:104
#: 8b7707469d004d5f924b3a7925205bcf
msgid "探索：`[-180, 180, 30]`"
msgstr "Exploratory: `[-180, 180, 30]`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:106
#: 380f7dbe2d66469b900582df66c72156
msgid "Sequence Mode（sequence_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:108
#: 46fddbbd962d433f9d36ba1320ffe8fb
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Clockwise then counterclockwise'`。`Clockwise then "
"counterclockwise` 前半周期顺时针、后半周期逆时针；`Counterclockwise then clockwise` "
"相反；`Both` 两种都生成。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Clockwise then counterclockwise'`. `Clockwise then "
"counterclockwise` uses clockwise rotation in the first half-period and "
"counterclockwise rotation in the second. `Counterclockwise then "
"clockwise` reverses that order. `Both` generates both sequences."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:110
#: abc320ddef384054bb0fff657b701c5a
msgid "磁矩幅值"
msgstr "Moment magnitudes"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:112
#: 9633cef9bbae4e4a9e8b4a6e89bfcc65
msgid "Magnitude Source（magnitude_source）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:114
#: 20b60301e0084c63943248e23ce82200
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Existing initial magmoms'`。可选 `Existing initial magmoms` "
"复用已有磁矩，或 `Map/default magnitude` 用元素映射生成幅值。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `'Existing initial magmoms'`. Choose `Existing initial "
"magmoms` to reuse stored moments or `Map/default magnitude` to create "
"magnitudes from an element map."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:116
#: b27b929adf454d9789010ef69ed87d5e
msgid "**`Magmom Map`** / **`Default Moment`**：仅在 `Map/default magnitude` 模式下生效。"
msgstr ""
"**`Magmom Map`** / **`Default Moment`**: used only in `Map/default "
"magnitude` mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:118
#: 9998540f2c4f4fef9b3f9ef0385d8a66
msgid "Magmom Map（magmom_map）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:120
#: 2364b20266d14823bdca171f17939303
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。已知元素局域磁矩时显式写入，如 `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`。未知元素不要用默认值伪造先验。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `''`. Provide known element-resolved local moments "
"explicitly, for example `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`. Do not invent a prior for an "
"unknown element through a default value."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:122
#: 8b456d5599354d7497b2579f09998e8a
msgid "Default Moment（default_moment）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:124
#: 8d1fe5384c82442e989073a1f963ef34
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.0`。只作为 `magmom_map` 未命中元素的兜底幅值。关键磁性元素应显式列出，非磁元素通常保持 0。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.0`. Used only when an element is absent from "
"`magmom_map`. List important magnetic elements explicitly; nonmagnetic "
"elements should normally remain at 0."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:126
#: aca3de0a167b47a6b82d9f251e4b9802
msgid "Apply Elements（apply_elements）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:128
#: 5c826b93e6244fb68f26137dca125702
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。限制哪些元素施加折返纹理，留空则全部参与。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Restricts the folded texture to selected elements. "
"Leave empty to include all elements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:130
#: b071aa3bb0de494688a6871cbca932e2
msgid "输出预算"
msgstr "Output budget"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:132
#: 9766b0ea9fe147529b2253e2ac1161d8
msgid "Max Outputs（max_outputs）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:134
#: 7f86f66acf7a4367a7d61cf5a239f568
msgid "`int`，默认 `100`。半周期、角度、相位和手性会相乘放大输出数量。先用几十个确认相位和层识别无误，再放大到研究级扫描。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `100`. Half-periods, angles, phases, and chirality "
"sequences multiply the output count. Start with a few dozen structures to"
" verify layer detection and phase conventions before scaling up to a "
"research scan."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:136
#: 396791e92da64b8ab4d4811a156e919a
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:138
#: a42204a37caf4a439acb28d6d7ee6914
msgid "auto 模式单折返验证（~2 个输出，先确认分层和方向正确）"
msgstr ""
"Single-fold automatic-mode check (~2 outputs; verify layers and "
"directions first)"

