"  \"default_moment\": [0.0],\n"
"  \"apply_elements\": \"\",\n"
"  \"max_outputs\": [500]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:201
#: 598db73d6dd24d0fad64f62ffd5ba741
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:203
#: 87584037289e419db663d9aecd32f4ec
msgid "`Magnetic Order` → `Folded Helix`：先建立 FM/AFM 局域磁矩模长，再按层折返旋转"
msgstr ""
"`Magnetic Order` → `Folded Helix`: establish local FM/AFM moment "
"magnitudes, then rotate them in a folded layer pattern."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:204
#: 8c0cfd48ec2048858e5935f6738ea9bb
msgid "`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Folded Helix`：手动指定元素模长，再生成折返纹理"
msgstr ""
"`Set Magnetic Moments` → `Folded Helix`: assign element-specific "
"magnitudes manually, then generate the folded texture."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:205
#: c7f0dc3e5ecf477ca8eb06e0562a340a
msgid "`Group Label` → `Folded Helix`：先打 group 标签，再在特定子晶格上施加折返"
msgstr ""
"`Group Label` → `Folded Helix`: label groups first, then apply the fold "
"to a selected sublattice."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:207
#: 2abeb6dd575c4f92a126a62bd8167efa
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:209
#: 7beac037d25c497aa1c209bf5d6581f0
msgid ""
"**输出只有原始输入。** 磁矩幅值全为 0。检查 `magnitude_source` 和 `magmom_map`。结构只有 1 "
"层时折返无意义——至少需要 2 层。"
msgstr ""
"**Only the original input is returned.** All moment magnitudes are zero. "
"Check `magnitude_source` and `magmom_map`. A fold is undefined for a one-"
"layer structure; at least two layers are required."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:211
#: df2169a3604e4667849255f62ecd3150
msgid "**分层结果不符合预期。** `layer_axis` 方向是否正确？调整 `layer_tolerance`——太小把同层拆散，太大把不同层合并。"
msgstr ""
"**Layer detection is incorrect.** Check the direction of `layer_axis`, "
"then adjust `layer_tolerance`: a value that is too small splits one "
"physical layer, while a value that is too large merges neighboring "
"layers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:213
#: bb1ef391f517428f88d5ae32f4e763d3
msgid ""
"**auto 模式的半周期太小或太大。** auto 模式取 `(总层数 - 1) // 2`。如果结构有偶数层且你期望一个层作为转折峰，切到 "
"manual 模式手动指定 `half_period_layers`。"
msgstr ""
"**The automatic half-period is too short or too long.** Automatic mode "
"uses `(number of layers - 1) // 2`. For an even number of layers, if you "
"need a particular layer to be the turning peak, switch to manual mode and"
" set `half_period_layers`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:215
#: d400272209f7436f941760d9057af0a2
msgid "**输出相位看起来没有折返。** 如果层数太少（如 3 层），折返曲线不明显。用 6 层以上的结构效果更直观。"
msgstr ""
"**The output phase does not appear to fold.** With very few layers, such "
"as three, the triangular profile is difficult to see. A structure with at"
" least six layers makes the fold clearer."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:217
#: f2f7f537f8ed4ae8a3b9d6b5b0d1264d
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:219
#: 9ecad10d39f4459bb497d7cb999e0d31
msgid "`FoldedHelix(h=...,da=...,ph=...,seq=...,ax=...,pn=...)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:220
#: c1409cb736324997bf8036de58225c6f
msgid "`h`：半周期层步数"
msgstr "`h`: number of layer intervals in one half-period"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:221
#: 567d029782c0425c87ccdbc9cc4dabd0
msgid "`da`：层间转角"
msgstr "`da`: interlayer rotation angle"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:222
#: 952f87d027754ccc9ca76601288a407f
msgid "`ph`：全局相位"
msgstr "`ph`: global phase"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:223
#: c0007b1968874bcaae52b098fd2b00c3
msgid "`seq`：手性顺序（`cw-ccw` 或 `ccw-cw`）"
msgstr "`seq`: chirality sequence (`cw-ccw` or `ccw-cw`)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:224
#: a3ed46c0a793469fa2451c5d86dca848
msgid "`ax`：分层轴标签"
msgstr "`ax`: layer-axis label"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:225
#: ea990286440e42a693674725c88a981a
msgid "`pn`：旋转平面法向标签"
msgstr "`pn`: rotation-plane-normal label"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:227
#: 4ffd212a6a2348b9a5953b190d661f67
msgid "所有导出输出写入 `spin:R:3`；内部同步维护 ASE `initial_magmoms` 三列向量别名。"
msgstr ""
"All exported outputs use `spin:R:3`; an ASE `initial_magmoms` "
"three-component vector alias is kept in sync internally."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:229
#: d68d2f6feb774f529d4b2632f8c54ee8
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/folded-helix-card.md:231
#: e5ab92e6ff5c432998f7f8526b4ca1c8
msgid "无随机性。相同输入结构和相同参数 → 严格一致输出。分层原点固定为沿 `layer_axis` 投影后的最小层号。"
msgstr ""
"Deterministic. Identical input structures and parameters produce "
"identical output. The layer origin is fixed at the smallest projected "
"coordinate along `layer_axis`."
